description:
Fix concrete heading / ownership / continuation errors, and make each class
mechanically impossible to recur (not merely patched at the named examples).

Root cause: segmentation is heading-heuristic driven, so an unrecognised or
wrapped heading silently merges two source features, and locator emission cites
only the page where a record starts.

Required membership — all of:
- split Rock Gnome's Artificer's Lore from Ability Score Increase;
- restore the Wererat Hand Crossbow action boundary (the action is swallowed by
  its sibling);
- fix class Spellcasting / Cantrips subfeature granularity and ownership so the
  same concept is not modelled at different depths across classes;
- add the missing "Vehicles (land or water)" tool row;
- include all 23 adjacent-page locator gaps, and container-capacity page 70 (7
  container records cite p. 69 only);
- include spell-list pages and class primary-ability source pages at FIELD level,
  not record level;
- resolve all 187 ambiguous and 75 unresolved ownership entries.

Closes findings: SOL-008, SOL-009, SOL-010, F-15, F-17, F-30, CAP-010, CAP-012,
Fable F4.
